      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "258839AEC9E1120F",
      "text": "Vous êtes sculptrice.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "258838AEC9E1105C",
      "text": "Vous êtes maquilleuse professionnelle.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "FC4319675651BCEE",
      "text": "Mais non, enfin ! Bien que, je te l’accorde,\\nje ferais une excellente hôtesse de l’air.\\c\\nJe suis maquilleuse professionnelle !\\nTâche de t’en souvenir.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 152,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "F7C0B697ACE361E4",
      "text": "Mais non, enfin ! Tu confonds avec ce Champion\\nd’Arène fantasque.\\c\\nMoi, je suis maquilleuse professionnelle !\\nTâche de t’en souvenir.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_02c",
      "hash64": "F7C0B797ACE36397",
      "text": "Tout à fait ! Je suis bien maquilleuse\\nprofessionnelle !\\c\\nEt je suis également mannequin et Championne\\nd’Arène en parallèle.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "FC431A675651BEA1",
      "text": "Ici, je suis relativement peu connue. Mais quand\\nje parle de mon travail, les gens montrent\\r\\nun intérêt particulier ![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "FC431B675651C054",
      "text": "À l’inverse de Paldea, où tout le monde sait qui\\nje suis, à l’étranger, je dois repartir de zéro.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "FC431C675651C207",
      "text": "Tout cela me donne envie de partager le secret\\nde la beauté à la Tully avec le monde entier ![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "CE890D60F3760F59",
      "text": "J’y pense, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], te souviens-tu de\\nla promesse que tu m’as faite ?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
