        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "CE890C60F3760DA6",
      "text": "Tu es remarquable ! Il est très important\\nde se rappeler des conseils de ses aînés.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "68EDCCBDB199640C",
      "text": "Ce petit côté tête en l’air est très mignon,\\nmais pense à être plus attenti[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0201)]fve.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
