    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "CE890B60F3760BF3",
      "text": "Tu m’avais promis de continuer à cultiver\\nton talent et à te dépasser...[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "CE890A60F3760A40",
      "text": "Et à ce que je vois, je n’ai pas à m’en faire !\\c\\nTu es si exceptionnel[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0200)]le que c’en est\\ndifficilement croyable ![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0200"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "CE891160F3761625",
      "text": "J’ai l’intime conviction que tu iras loin.\\c\\nNe voudrais-tu pas intégrer mon entreprise,\\nlorsque tu seras un peu plus grand[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
