    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "EDF60E1629A1C954",
      "text": "Je suis une personne extrêmement occupée, mais\\nsache que si tu as besoin de moi, j’accourrai\\r\\naussi vite que possible, qu’importe l’heure.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "EDF60F1629A1CB07",
      "text": "Je suis curieuse de savoir comment Élige s’en sort\\nen tant que professeure, car elle a toujours été\\r\\nquelque peu étourdie.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "EDF6101629A1CCBA",
      "text": "Rester dans la même position trop longtemps est\\ntrès mauvais.\\c\\nAfin d’éviter cela, je préconise bien évidemment\\nle Fitness Émotion ![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "EDF6111629A1CE6D",
      "text": "Ton [VAR 0x0101(0001)] a un très bon potentiel.\\c\\nFais-moi confiance, je vais le rendre encore plus\\nresplendissant qu’il ne l’est déjà.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
